<section begin=intro />
The '''Dex Pixia''' are {{WF|Titania}}'s and {{WF|Titania Prime}}'s signature dual pistols, summoned by activating the ability {{A|Razorwing}}.
<section end=intro />

==Characteristics==
*This weapon deals primarily {{D|Slash}} damage.
*Innate two {{Pol|Madurai}} and one {{Pol|Naramon}} polarities.
*Does not use ammo pickups; ammo regenerates over time.
**Has a 0.3-second delay after the weapon stops firing before regenerating ammo.
***Regenerates 50 ammo per second; takes 1.2 seconds to regenerate a fully depleted magazine.

{{Advantages|name=Dex Pixia}}

{{Disadvantages|name=Dex Pixia|*Requires energy to activate and keep active.}}

==Notes==
*The Dex Pixia appears in the [[Arsenal]] after unlocking Titania's {{A|Razorwing}} ability.
*As an Exalted Weapon, this weapon comes with an {{Resource|Orokin Catalyst}} pre-installed.

==Trivia==
*On {{WF|Titania Prime}}, the pistols are named {{Weapon|Dex Pixia Prime}}. Their stats are, however, identical to the Dex Pixia.
*Despite being called a "Dex" weapon, it has no relation to the [[Dex]] anniversary weapon series.
*The weapon's name is based on ''[[wikipedia:Pixie|Pixies]]'', small, fairy-like mythical creatures similar to Titania.
*Before the introduction of moddable [[Exalted Weapon]]s, the stats of Dex Pixia depended on the mods equipped on the player's Primary weapon, technically making it the only dual-wielded primary weapon. Uniquely, it also scaled from equipped Shotgun mods, making it the first weapon able to use both Rifle and Shotgun mods.
**{{ver|23}} changed the mods that affect Dex Pixia from Primary to Secondary weapon mods only.

